{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Dragon Fist","The story follows Ling Fei-long, a Chinese transfer student living in Japan. Ling is the son of the leader of the White Dragon clan, one of four clans who live in the mountains of China and are descended from mythical beasts. After killing an ordinary human, Ling is banished to Japan so that he might learn about humanity and how to control his powers around them."],"ja":["ドラゴンフィスト",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-21179","ids":{"shikimori":21179,"mal":21179,"anilist":100110,"kodik":"movie-47820"},"kodikIds":["movie-41981","movie-73260","movie-47820"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-41981":"2021-05-24T12:47:17Z","movie-73260":"2021-05-24T12:47:35Z","movie-47820":"2020-01-16T14:44:50Z"},"title":"Кулак дракона","originalTitle":"Dragon Fist","alt":"Кулак дракона OVA ドラゴンフィスト","description":"История рассказывает о Лин Фэйлун Лин, китайской студентке-переводчице, живущей в Японии. Лин - сын вождя клана Белого дракона, одного из четырех кланов, которые живут в горах Китая и происходят от мифических зверей. После убийства обычного человека Лина изгоняют в Японию, чтобы он мог узнать о человечестве и о том, как контролировать свои силы вокруг них.","year":1991,"type":"OVA","genres":["седзе","Экшен","Драма","Фэнтези","боевые искусства"],"rating":4.48,"popularity":1135,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/21179/f4560a06f4260acd9e3ab8faf870699c.jpeg","width":575,"height":780},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/fe9642470253d45284ec4c4eb245fa84e4ba7efb.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1154","dubId":"1154","label":"micola777","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-41981","tra